---
import Layout from '../../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<div class="space-y-8">
		<!-- School Projects -->
		<div>
			<h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">school projects</h2>

			<section>
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-2">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Booomtag AI Dashboard</h3>
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">[2025]</h3>
				</div>
				<p>
					Developed an AI-powered analytical dashboard using Python, Streamlit, Ollama, and MySQL
					to provide interactive data visualization and business insights.
				</p>
				<small>python • streamlit • ollama • mysql</small>
			</section>

			<hr class="my-6" />

			<section>
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-2">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Election Results Site</h3>
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">[2024]</h3>
				</div>
				<p>
					Developed an election results dashboard with Vue, Spring Boot, JWT, Docker, PostgreSQL,
					and a real-time forum for user discussions.
				</p>
				<small>vue • spring boot • jwt • docker • postgres</small>
			</section>

			<hr class="my-6" />

			<section>
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-2">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Student Casino</h3>
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">[2024]</h3>
				</div>
				<p>
					Built a dynamic gambling website with HTML, CSS, JS, PHP, and SQL, featuring coin-based
					gameplay and a virtual store for student items.
				</p>
				<small>js • php • sql</small>
			</section>

			<hr class="my-6" />

			<section>
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-2">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Project Agile Development</h3>
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">[2023]</h3>
				</div>
				<p>
					Built an interactive dashboard for AUAS Open Day with Node.js, Express, JavaScript,
					Bootstrap, and Cypress, featuring an interactive map, FAQs, trial lesson signups, and organizer management. Managed via GitLab.
				</p>
				<small>node.js • express • javascript • bootstrap • cypress</small>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
